+| 23 | `For(Expr,Expr,Stmts) [strict(2)]` | yes | Iterable evaluated before iteration; targets are names. |
+| 24 | `Return(Expr) [strict]` | yes | Return expression evaluated. |
+| 26 | `Int(Int)` | yes | Integer literals 0 and 1. |
