@@ -0,0 +1,152 @@
+# Exhaustive local syntax and rule inventory
+
+Source hashes:
+
+- `semantic.k`: `ba5b90011ca2cd389b5c6527d98e58d599580c775dde389828a6ab36552c9c0c`
